# state: any   (classifier-path benchmark opening; #433 step 6c)
# Midnight Club II (54540008), classifier-path benchmark (#433): drive
# generic replaces the blind opening and marks gameplay itself once play is
# confirmed. A racer: hold the throttle, steer with LX -- never START.
# Loop shape from burnout.route's proven racer pattern.
drive generic 300 mark
axis RT max
repeat forever {
    axis RT max
    axis LX min
    wait 1.5
    axis LX max
    wait 1.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 3
}
